<p>Sampling needs none of this machinery. It integrates a pixel-space ODE from noise to data —
no encoder, no decoder, nothing to reconstruct through.</p>

<h2 id="does-the-detour-actually-speed-things-up">Does the detour actually speed things up?</h2>

<p>Each row adds one piece to plain pixel flow, using the <em>same</em> network (JiT-B, 296M, unguided FID,
Heun 50 steps). Putting DINOv2 features into the path is by far the largest single gain.</p>

