<p>Semantic latent diffusion still converges faster, but the detour recovers much of the advantage
while generating directly in pixels.</p>

<h2 id="imagenet">ImageNet</h2>

<p>At 256×256, Detour-XL/16 reaches <strong>FID-50k 1.43</strong> in 200 epochs; at 512×512, Detour-XL/32 reaches
<strong>1.59</strong> in 160 epochs. Without guidance the same models reach 3.69 and 4.19.</p>

<p>Guidance matters, and the two kinds compose. Classifier-free guidance alone plateaus; autoguidance
alone is already better at a much lower Inception score; together they are better than either.</p>

