<h2 id="text-to-image">Text to image</h2>

<p>The path needs no class labels, so it transfers to text-to-image directly. With matched networks
it reaches comparable text alignment in <strong>1.5× fewer training iterations</strong> than plain pixel flow.</p>

<p>A 3.3B model scores <strong>GenEval 0.90 / DPG-Bench 87.8</strong> at 512×512 and <strong>0.88 / 87.4</strong> at 1024×1024 —
ahead of the pixel-space models we compare against at both resolutions, while keeping the fine
textures and rendered text that a semantic-latent decoder can lose.</p>

